Ranger or Rouge throwing highly enchanted daggers do more
damage than any other weapon in the game, even when
two-weaponing. Ranger + throwing highly enchanted poisoned
darts is probably _the_ most powerful attack on the average.

For those classes at least, melee is a suboptimal strategy.
Of course, fireing at point-blank range could be considered
melee, in which case that is not always a bad idea. (Easier
way to take out a unicorn in my experiance. Boomerangs
are probably the easiest, but they are quite rare)

Of course, this does not cover all classes. Not everyone
gets a +1 multishot bonus from daggers/arrows, not
everyone gets an infinite source of arrows, not everyone
can get expert in daggers/bow/darts...

